  "intro": "“ruta por Perú 10 días”, “itinerario Perú 7 días”, “circuito Perú todo incluido”, “mejor ruta para Machu Picchu”. 1 […]",
  "content_html": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em><strong>“ruta por Perú 10 días”, “itinerario Perú 7 días”, “circuito Perú todo incluido”, “mejor ruta para Machu Picchu”</strong></em>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"> 1 Ruta Clásica: Lima + Cusco + Machu Picchu (7 Días)</h1>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/J8yA-CZ-fIOO_UEYdPiBG1l5hvtXoZkK4Ex1nNI4Pn2_y9wmIn7WUqpWOpNePOy-xASn99Zk4I4KLmdJJ58F5bp3fL8z1X8q7t0eTXDFVNA?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/J8yA-CZ-fIOO_UEYdPiBG1l5hvtXoZkK4Ex1nNI4Pn2_y9wmIn7WUqpWOpNePOy-xASn99Zk4I4KLmdJJ58F5bp3fL8z1X8q7t0eTXDFVNA?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/Oc6hma7IPzUjQI0J5nNFUuR45QRZsWl4Qlu_g4OojY-rSy7U6rjytT-A0hzRoNCdk9ufWEhKVtOZGlL9zI1f-bbjG51k6Q3zbdocHIedCnU?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/Oc6hma7IPzUjQI0J5nNFUuR45QRZsWl4Qlu_g4OojY-rSy7U6rjytT-A0hzRoNCdk9ufWEhKVtOZGlL9zI1f-bbjG51k6Q3zbdocHIedCnU?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/n0NHJURl2LAlSTNY-zRMPMcXW7gIwYT9xL4QiD1FuMFgTcfFQLANNz6TwE0G3AQ3XVcF2UCnpMJ2lKPAiIl526F1qzvtsE8wxiTDL196cp8?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/n0NHJURl2LAlSTNY-zRMPMcXW7gIwYT9xL4QiD1FuMFgTcfFQLANNz6TwE0G3AQ3XVcF2UCnpMJ2lKPAiIl526F1qzvtsE8wxiTDL196cp8?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Ruta Perú 7 días / Itinerario Perú 1 semana</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"ideal-para\"> Ideal para:</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Primer viaje a Perú</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"alta-conversi-on-porque-incluye\"> Alta conversión porque incluye:</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>City tour en Lima</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Vuelo interno a Cusco</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Valle Sagrado</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tren + entrada a Machu Picchu</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Hoteles y traslados</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"> 2 Ruta Aventura: Lima + Paracas + Huacachina + Cusco (8–10 Días)</h1>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/lSoVvQdYQ-WvTKBAbf2BUJ2I6MZSWqIEtm9qh3K2jnA_UtWK_rGd2AMj8juBy1snK651NqM_aaJEczyXL2DbnHrwDZW93PShhVlrv6sUg84?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/lSoVvQdYQ-WvTKBAbf2BUJ2I6MZSWqIEtm9qh3K2jnA_UtWK_rGd2AMj8juBy1snK651NqM_aaJEczyXL2DbnHrwDZW93PShhVlrv6sUg84?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/_eN9j-aqlEYUlu8oBGNzOS6LUEmAgYS8Lws9d4vHpuo90VTdWyHpwpvBUrYPPHufJPlyPQivIIxNPBZn7XSy_ODlCa5r1XsGGfe_ZsVxVqc?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/_eN9j-aqlEYUlu8oBGNzOS6LUEmAgYS8Lws9d4vHpuo90VTdWyHpwpvBUrYPPHufJPlyPQivIIxNPBZn7XSy_ODlCa5r1XsGGfe_ZsVxVqc?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/4s2xeFzSdmj0aF-eNWNsB3XFZkEBoELJZLSTLDJ8U5rkod3-3PxHRYmrHukJY-liNgDMu8YzjbXkJJenPeUkcS5a2EOiwCsR8XK_t9-1OuI?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/4s2xeFzSdmj0aF-eNWNsB3XFZkEBoELJZLSTLDJ8U5rkod3-3PxHRYmrHukJY-liNgDMu8YzjbXkJJenPeUkcS5a2EOiwCsR8XK_t9-1OuI?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Ruta Perú 10 días / Perú completo itinerario</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Incluye:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Islas Ballestas</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sandboard en Huacachina</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sobrevuelo Líneas de Nazca</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cusco + Machu Picchu</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"> 3 Ruta Sur Andina: Arequipa + Colca + Puno + Cusco (10–12 Días)</h1>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/DW_RadhjcwkHeCAdYE0K93C22pVFwauW-JnSHqXVCaJrCLKiTDpppBHTNTZx2ZinoqfHH7CDuWXAQe_5wkGihrGJwC9CZNlmS09aQm_OOP8?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/DW_RadhjcwkHeCAdYE0K93C22pVFwauW-JnSHqXVCaJrCLKiTDpppBHTNTZx2ZinoqfHH7CDuWXAQe_5wkGihrGJwC9CZNlmS09aQm_OOP8?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/q_ejvAEf2dvuY6-4wP-Hr7uSZwoFBQJ5ErhpL-TgaSELTP5yTVDfXjbZ92VRT1qry4KT0SxqbLJgbpfLguPtjDjuNLo7lgAY1nYnS5W-R-Y?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/q_ejvAEf2dvuY6-4wP-Hr7uSZwoFBQJ5ErhpL-TgaSELTP5yTVDfXjbZ92VRT1qry4KT0SxqbLJgbpfLguPtjDjuNLo7lgAY1nYnS5W-R-Y?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/N83IDjZSRviOSaKV6yI4MPwuBA2ZjDC-asedRxZkotCAsbT7_iPeBMOIJKzLZlGtQiNBMfWfYOX6ispPuTEwWWhMkMiAT5CS9XPwX7RSIec?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/N83IDjZSRviOSaKV6yI4MPwuBA2ZjDC-asedRxZkotCAsbT7_iPeBMOIJKzLZlGtQiNBMfWfYOX6ispPuTEwWWhMkMiAT5CS9XPwX7RSIec?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Circuito Sur Perú 12 días</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Incluye:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Cañón del Colca</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lago Titicaca</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Montaña de 7 Colores</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Machu Picchu</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\"> 4 Ruta Relax + Cultura: Playas del Norte + Cusco (9 Días)</h1>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/4BA0OPdX_9yx-tVpZb1IYeTib-Ww2AB5cNqdx4frOonps1OwR6qYSI3Fy56ueO4htH43EbdZFkT2Jmk9ibSKm2MmfI1EcXVEZx-3yQx8NPk?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/4BA0OPdX_9yx-tVpZb1IYeTib-Ww2AB5cNqdx4frOonps1OwR6qYSI3Fy56ueO4htH43EbdZFkT2Jmk9ibSKm2MmfI1EcXVEZx-3yQx8NPk?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"https://gtperutravel.com/\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/a7/62/b4/punta-sal.jpg?h=800&amp;s=1&amp;w=800\" alt=\"https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/18/a7/62/b4/punta-sal.jpg?h=800&amp;s=1&amp;w=800\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/-hAdLW7KhOqgBDpJ-cc5R5mMZxNz27z7fOA2NQEdgj-OAxwW37p3MbZQhJVuApQgo0W2G8HXmeR792SVR_7wkAZcl-I4znlWwiLZ2m7B9es?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/-hAdLW7KhOqgBDpJ-cc5R5mMZxNz27z7fOA2NQEdgj-OAxwW37p3MbZQhJVuApQgo0W2G8HXmeR792SVR_7wkAZcl-I4znlWwiLZ2m7B9es?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Playas de Perú + Machu Picchu itinerario</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ideal para:<br>Viajeros que buscan cultura + descanso<br><br> 5 Ruta Naturaleza: Amazonía + Cusco (8 Días)</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/0e/df/97/09/amazon-rainforest-lodge.jpg?h=500&amp;s=1&amp;w=900\" alt=\"https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/0e/df/97/09/amazon-rainforest-lodge.jpg?h=500&amp;s=1&amp;w=900\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><a href=\"http://www.gtperutravel.com\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/liwcPVuBeOcEkKCyo9BnVsdBL3_UJzYHnUTzeaqqUhG319Nz68rQTEO7xgBf-CkO00GMVYjG8gywZ4N8ewkfJdaWtFqb2o1zrt42QmTC7fE?purpose=fullsize&amp;v=1\" alt=\"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-3/liwcPVuBeOcEkKCyo9BnVsdBL3_UJzYHnUTzeaqqUhG319Nz68rQTEO7xgBf-CkO00GMVYjG8gywZ4N8ewkfJdaWtFqb2o1zrt42QmTC7fE